{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "cmrop015vm4bpi3e", "title": "92.HF Transformers快速入门教程", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u9a750728\" id=\"u9a750728\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4500da3\" id=\"uf4500da3\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0b0c1578\" id=\"u0b0c1578\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fppt%2F1387387%2F1745159926153-a210d9f6-622c-4bf1-a5d1-00862fc45b23.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22transformers-demo.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A11566%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6be71f55-b63a-4a3b-8747-1a0f6c0a066%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u05233b77%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2a34d5f0\" id=\"u2a34d5f0\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9eed3d13\" id=\"u9eed3d13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9d0f9788\" id=\"u9d0f9788\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b6ccf17\" id=\"u5b6ccf17\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">python版本：3.12.4</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0b99d5e5\" id=\"u0b99d5e5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9e396a5\" id=\"ud9e396a5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u01a6dc8a\" id=\"u01a6dc8a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba1bfae4\" id=\"uba1bfae4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">现在做 NLP 方面的研究实在离不开预训练语言模型，尤其是 BERT。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0010a986\" id=\"u0010a986\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf625e1de\" id=\"uf625e1de\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">huggingface 的 transformers 包是目前使用 BERT 最主流最方便的工具之一</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ued96a08a\" id=\"ued96a08a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub88e23c4\" id=\"ub88e23c4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">注：由于官方文档和网页时常更新，链接失效是很有可能的！</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufbaf5d4a\" id=\"ufbaf5d4a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d1b3e9a\" id=\"u0d1b3e9a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">本次使用的 transformers 版本为 4.15.0</span></p><ol list=\"uc696d24e\"><li fid=\"uc2a44a2a\" data-lake-id=\"ubcede4d1\" id=\"ubcede4d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1e8a47e6\" id=\"u1e8a47e6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">预训练模型下载</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"u0d686f64\" id=\"u0d686f64\"><code data-lake-id=\"u93464bf6\" id=\"u93464bf6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c7876bf\" id=\"u3c7876bf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">huggingface/transformers</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc5a748f6\" id=\"uc5a748f6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 支持的所有模型：</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/models\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ue46c36f6\" id=\"ue46c36f6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06875414\" id=\"u06875414\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 131, 196)\">https://huggingface.co/models</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u40acd89c\" id=\"u40acd89c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ube87c83a\" id=\"ube87c83a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">如果环境支持科学上网，可以通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc740890f\" id=\"uc740890f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b9fd4d7\" id=\"u5b9fd4d7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">git lfs</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u30e9b1af\" id=\"u30e9b1af\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">命令直接下载模型。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22git%20lfs%20install%5Cngit%20clone%20https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fbert-base-chinese%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OCaeH%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u18797ad9\" id=\"u18797ad9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc6c01bd0\" id=\"uc6c01bd0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">如果需要手动下载模型并上传至服务器，则可以在 huggingface 的网页中手动下载模型。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1320159a\" id=\"u1320159a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud3578220\" id=\"ud3578220\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">通常我们需要保存的是三个文件及一些额外的文件</span></p><ul list=\"u2fe509e4\"><li fid=\"uaee5e4f9\" data-lake-id=\"u63863f16\" id=\"u63863f16\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ad9ce5b\" id=\"u6ad9ce5b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">配置文件 config.json</span></li><li fid=\"uaee5e4f9\" data-lake-id=\"u375b81b2\" id=\"u375b81b2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc994fd22\" id=\"uc994fd22\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">词典文件 vocab.json</span></li><li fid=\"uaee5e4f9\" data-lake-id=\"ubd78686d\" id=\"ubd78686d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf159935\" id=\"ucf159935\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">预训练模型文件，如果你使用 pytorch 则保存 pytorch_model.bin，如果你使用 tensorflow 2 则保存 tf_model.h5</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u04c20fb4\" id=\"u04c20fb4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud2bbdfbb\" id=\"ud2bbdfbb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">额外的文件，指的是 merges.txt、special_tokens_map.json、added_tokens.json、tokenizer_config.json、sentencepiece.bpe.</span><a href=\"https://so.csdn.net/so/search?q=model&amp;spm=1001.2101.3001.7020\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ua2ec762a\" id=\"ua2ec762a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u059d281e\" id=\"u059d281e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 131, 196)\">model</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u1a0ee5a2\" id=\"u1a0ee5a2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 等，这几类是 tokenizer 需要使用的文件，如果出现的话，也需要保存下来。没有的话，就不必在意。如果不确定哪些需要下，哪些不需要的话，可以把类似的文件全部下载下来。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u08740020\" id=\"u08740020\"><span data-lake-id=\"u514250a9\" id=\"u514250a9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">以 </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/bert-base-chinese\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u02f5686b\" id=\"u02f5686b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1af28c2f\" id=\"u1af28c2f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 131, 196)\">bert-base-chinese</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u66f87deb\" id=\"u66f87deb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 模型为例，点击 Files and versions，下载所需的文件，放入与模型同名的文件夹中。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3b0ea41c\" id=\"u3b0ea41c\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1744870135081-f73ccdd2-3e07-414d-b57d-b3179a95b842.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u075d3868-d6f2-41ea-848e-55e57c63a24%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u497ba159-8485-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1881%2C%22originHeight%22%3A787%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.6500000953674316%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e9cea9%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua6ddf0a3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5f20df30\" id=\"u5f20df30\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u62575fb3\" id=\"u62575fb3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">下载后，需保持文件夹和文件名称与仓库中的一致。</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubccd229b\" id=\"ubccd229b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub2b32b56\" id=\"ub2b32b56\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">模型的快速使用</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoTokenizer%2C%20AutoModelForMaskedLM%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(%5C%22bert-base-chinese%5C%22)%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForMaskedLM.from_pretrained(%5C%22bert-base-chinese%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22J4yYK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u92702e54\" id=\"u92702e54\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc782ba90\" id=\"uc782ba90\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9bd5322e\" id=\"u9bd5322e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">from_pretrained()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u69b5dd9c\" id=\"u69b5dd9c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">的参数</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue9f184c0\" id=\"ue9f184c0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87810384\" id=\"u87810384\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">pretrained_model_name_or_path</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4fafd3b7\" id=\"u4fafd3b7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">，可以接受的参数有如下几种：</span></p><ul list=\"u4c729dd2\"><li fid=\"ue984dc00\" data-lake-id=\"u730c7a92\" id=\"u730c7a92\"><span data-lake-id=\"ube669add\" id=\"ube669add\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">short-cut name（缩写名称，类似于 gpt2 这种）</span></li><li fid=\"ue984dc00\" data-lake-id=\"u4ebf49bd\" id=\"u4ebf49bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub583b27a\" id=\"ub583b27a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">identifier name（类似于 microsoft/DialoGPT-small 这种）</span></li><li fid=\"ue984dc00\" data-lake-id=\"ud6bac913\" id=\"ud6bac913\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e9844cd\" id=\"u5e9844cd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">文件夹</span></li><li fid=\"ue984dc00\" data-lake-id=\"uc1e58288\" id=\"uc1e58288\"><span data-lake-id=\"u54b97e20\" id=\"u54b97e20\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">文件</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u78aa697a\" id=\"u78aa697a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b3120f9\" id=\"u2b3120f9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">对于 short-cut name 或 identifier name，这种情况下，本地有文件，可以使用本地的，本地没有文件，则会自动下载。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4e0a321f\" id=\"u4e0a321f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub650a40a\" id=\"ub650a40a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">一些常用的 short-cut name，可以在 </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/models\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"udc51352a\" id=\"udc51352a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0d5b6066\" id=\"u0d5b6066\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 131, 196)\">https://huggingface.co/models</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue06c64c2\" id=\"ue06c64c2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 中查看</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4fffd620\" id=\"u4fffd620\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae04211e\" id=\"uae04211e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">对于文件夹，则会从文件夹中找 vocab.json、pytorch_model.bin、tf_model.h5、merges.txt、special_tokens_map.json、added_tokens.json、tokenizer_config.json、sentencepiece.bpe.model 等进行加载。所以这也是为什么下载的时候，一定要保证这些名称是这几个，不能变。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u102d4080\" id=\"u102d4080\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9702da5\" id=\"ud9702da5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">对于文件，则会直接加载文件。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u043ee974\" id=\"u043ee974\"><span data-lake-id=\"u16e18b6a\" id=\"u16e18b6a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">官方给的样例，通常都是 short-cut name，我们可以将之替换为下载好的模型文件夹路径。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoTokenizer%2C%20AutoModelForMaskedLM%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(local_model_path)%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForMaskedLM.from_pretrained(local_model_path)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LioCS%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub88a58ee\" id=\"ub88a58ee\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0065c681\" id=\"u0065c681\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">官方 Quick tour</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7480d7fe\" id=\"u7480d7fe\"><a href=\"https://colab.research.google.com/github/huggingface/notebooks/blob/main/transformers_doc/en/pytorch/quicktour.ipynb\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u5eb0db1d\" id=\"u5eb0db1d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u46a0cc8f\" id=\"u46a0cc8f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 131, 196)\">Quick tour 代码实时运行（google Colab）</span></a></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"1.-pipeline-api\" id=\"1.-pipeline-api\"><span data-lake-id=\"u838faf4c\" id=\"u838faf4c\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">1. pipeline API</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ud9628e26\" id=\"ud9628e26\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa2013da\" id=\"uaa2013da\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">在给定任务上使用预训练模型的最简单方法是使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u635047c8\" id=\"u635047c8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a9d429d\" id=\"u8a9d429d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">pipeline()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u6eb23d2a\" id=\"u6eb23d2a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">。Transformers 为以下任务提供了开箱即用的接口：</span></p><ul list=\"uc1b2e869\"><li fid=\"u1202fb3a\" data-lake-id=\"ub89dc8bd\" id=\"ub89dc8bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3fbd7fa2\" id=\"u3fbd7fa2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">情感分析（Sentiment analysis）</span></li><li fid=\"u1202fb3a\" data-lake-id=\"ub834dfa7\" id=\"ub834dfa7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f472e48\" id=\"u0f472e48\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">英语文本生成（Text generation in English）</span></li><li fid=\"u1202fb3a\" data-lake-id=\"u2b4a7bde\" id=\"u2b4a7bde\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ef4ecfa\" id=\"u9ef4ecfa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">命令实体识别（Name entity recognition, NER）</span></li><li fid=\"u1202fb3a\" data-lake-id=\"ue3b01b0e\" id=\"ue3b01b0e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca2b6df6\" id=\"uca2b6df6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">QA</span></li><li fid=\"u1202fb3a\" data-lake-id=\"uc9a3bf83\" id=\"uc9a3bf83\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub84993c4\" id=\"ub84993c4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">文本填空: 给定带有被屏蔽词的文本（例如，用 [mask] 替换），然后填入空白处</span></li><li fid=\"u1202fb3a\" data-lake-id=\"ufb2c1ba8\" id=\"ufb2c1ba8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5436d052\" id=\"u5436d052\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">摘要（Summarization）</span></li><li fid=\"u1202fb3a\" data-lake-id=\"u844b23b8\" id=\"u844b23b8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubeb5ae92\" id=\"ubeb5ae92\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">翻译</span></li><li fid=\"u1202fb3a\" data-lake-id=\"u7ed167c7\" id=\"u7ed167c7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c29566d\" id=\"u1c29566d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">特征提取: 返回文本的向量表示</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u9c5a7b9a\" id=\"u9c5a7b9a\"><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/docs/transformers/v4.15.0/en/task_summary\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u48136ac8\" id=\"u48136ac8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud532501d\" id=\"ud532501d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 131, 196)\">所有任务的示例代码</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"u109c2115\" id=\"u109c2115\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud2de9978\" id=\"ud2de9978\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">下面以情感分析任务为例</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20pipeline%5Cnclassifier%20%3D%20pipeline('sentiment-analysis')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22P0dTz%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u62ee9209\" id=\"u62ee9209\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c09f859\" id=\"u3c09f859\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">第一次键入此命令时，将下载对应的预训练模型和它的分词器（</span><a href=\"https://so.csdn.net/so/search?q=tokenizer&amp;spm=1001.2101.3001.7020\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"udda662ba\" id=\"udda662ba\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueaca04f7\" id=\"ueaca04f7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 131, 196)\">tokenizer</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ub1ee7a77\" id=\"ub1ee7a77\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">）。分词器的作用是将文本先进行预处理，然后将分词结果输入模型进行预测。管道将所有这些信息组合在一起，并对预测进行后期处理，使其可读。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u72f023e5\" id=\"u72f023e5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf03738e9\" id=\"uf03738e9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">简单使用：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22classifier('We%20are%20very%20happy%20to%20show%20you%20the%20%F0%9F%A4%97%20Transformers%20library.')%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PIHhg%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u381f4073\" id=\"u381f4073\"><span data-lake-id=\"u67cb3d5b\" id=\"u67cb3d5b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">也可以输入句子的 list，返回的结果将是一个字典列表。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22results%20%3D%20classifier(%5B%5C%22We%20are%20very%20happy%20to%20show%20you%20the%20%F0%9F%A4%97%20Transformers%20library.%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22We%20hope%20you%20don't%20hate%20it.%5C%22%5D)%5Cnfor%20result%20in%20results%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22label%3A%20%7Bresult%5B'label'%5D%7D%2C%20with%20score%3A%20%7Bround(result%5B'score'%5D%2C%204)%7D%5C%22)%5Cn%23%20label%3A%20POSITIVE%2C%20with%20score%3A%200.9998%5Cn%23%20label%3A%20NEGATIVE%2C%20with%20score%3A%200.5309%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pSECB%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc2c2ab2c\" id=\"uc2c2ab2c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4356969\" id=\"ud4356969\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">默认这个 pipeline 下载的模型是 “distilbert-base-uncased-finetuned-sst-2-english”，我们可以在 huggingface 的网站中找到更多用于文本分类的 BERT 模型，地址为 </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/models?pipeline_tag=text-classification\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3ccbed2c\" id=\"u3ccbed2c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u116ed854\" id=\"u116ed854\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 131, 196)\">https://huggingface.co/models?pipeline_tag=text-classification</span></a></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua681579f\" id=\"ua681579f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a1b5df4\" id=\"u6a1b5df4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">选择使用模型的代码如下：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22classifier%20%3D%20pipeline('sentiment-analysis'%2C%20model%3D%5C%22techthiyanes%2Fchinese_sentiment%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wXS1x%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud8aab21a\" id=\"ud8aab21a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae05a21d\" id=\"uae05a21d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">我们也可以使用保存在本地的预训练模型。我们需要向 pipeline 中传递一个模型对象和其相应的分词器。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3c154f4d\" id=\"u3c154f4d\"><span data-lake-id=\"udf080ee4\" id=\"udf080ee4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">我们将需要两个类来完成这个工作。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua05b6d24\" id=\"ua05b6d24\"><span data-lake-id=\"u323f416b\" id=\"u323f416b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">第一个是 AutoTokenizer，我们将使用它下载与我们选择的模型关联的分词器，并对它进行实例化。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc7c58eaf\" id=\"uc7c58eaf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucdd08705\" id=\"ucdd08705\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">第二个是 AutoModelForSequenceClassification，我们将使用它来下载模型本身。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoTokenizer%2C%20AutoModelForSequenceClassification%5Cnmodel_name%20%3D%20%5C%22nlptown%2Fbert-base-multilingual-uncased-sentiment%5C%22%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(model_name)%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)%5Cnclassifier%20%3D%20pipeline('sentiment-analysis'%2C%20model%3Dmodel%2C%20tokenizer%3Dtokenizer)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fNRWI%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ucbc5cf27\" id=\"ucbc5cf27\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud923d151\" id=\"ud923d151\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119)\">请注意，如果我们在其他任务中使用该库，则模型的类将发生更改。详情见 </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/transformers/v4.6.0/task_summary.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u68002e77\" id=\"u68002e77\"><span data-lake-id=\"u061157c9\" id=\"u061157c9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 131, 196)\">Summary of the tasks</span></a></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"581e6b63\" id=\"581e6b63\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3123d9d7\" id=\"u3123d9d7\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">2. pipeline 的工作原理</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ufc7651b1\" id=\"ufc7651b1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucadc37a2\" id=\"ucadc37a2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">如下面的代码所示，模型和分词器是通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"udcd8bcfe\" id=\"udcd8bcfe\"><span data-lake-id=\"u13f45637\" id=\"u13f45637\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">from_pretrained</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud0ce0925\" id=\"ud0ce0925\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">方法创建的。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoTokenizer%2C%20AutoModelForSequenceClassification%5Cnmodel_name%20%3D%20%5C%22distilbert-base-uncased-finetuned-sst-2-english%5C%22%5Cnpt_model%20%3D%20AutoModelForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(model_name)%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xe32s%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"f77a7bc0\" id=\"f77a7bc0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f538a01\" id=\"u0f538a01\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">2.1 使用分词器（tokenizer）</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u55370c5c\" id=\"u55370c5c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub40475de\" id=\"ub40475de\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">第一步，tokenizer 会将输入文本分成单词（或单词的一部分，标点符号等），通常称为标记（token）。因为存在不同的预处理方式，所以我们在实例化 tokenizer 的时候，需要传入预训练模型的模型名称。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubc01e887\" id=\"ubc01e887\"><span data-lake-id=\"ude8208ea\" id=\"ude8208ea\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">第二步，将 tokens 转换为数字，从而把输入文本转化成 tensor 的形式，输入对应的模型中。tokenizer 中有一个词表（vocab），在调用 from_pretrained 方法时下载的，因为我们需要使用和模型在预训练阶段用的一样的词表。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7088434c\" id=\"u7088434c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a649cac\" id=\"u8a649cac\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">为了实现上述的功能, 我们可以直接把文本传给 tokenizer。</span><span data-lake-id=\"u551cc451\" id=\"u551cc451\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">返回一个字典，包含的是 </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/transformers/v4.6.0/glossary.html#input-ids\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ucaa1d204\" id=\"ucaa1d204\"><span data-lake-id=\"u163db650\" id=\"u163db650\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 131, 196)\">input_ids</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u12211b23\" id=\"u12211b23\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">，还有 </span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/transformers/glossary.html#attention-mask\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u319fe076\" id=\"u319fe076\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11047cfb\" id=\"u11047cfb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 131, 196)\">attention mask</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uba66e796\" id=\"uba66e796\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">&quot;input_ids&quot; 是输入的 tokens 在词表中的 id，&quot;attention_mask&quot; 告诉模型哪些词需要关注，哪些词不需要关注。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22inputs%20%3D%20tokenizer(%5C%22We%20are%20very%20happy%20to%20show%20you%20the%20%F0%9F%A4%97%20Transformers%20library.%5C%22)%5Cnprint(inputs)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HCz6z%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20'input_ids'%3A%5B101%2C%202057%2C%202024%2C%202200%2C%203407%2C%202000%2C%202265%2C%202017%2C%201996%2C%20100%2C%2019081%2C%203075%2C%201012%2C%20102%5D%2C%20%5Ct%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20'attention_mask'%3A%20%5B1%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%5D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22pFYFF%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud1879c1e\" id=\"ud1879c1e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u30c531e4\" id=\"u30c531e4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">设置 tokenizer 的参数，比如将输入文本全部填充到相同的长度，将它们们截断到模型可接受的最大长度，然后返回张量。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pt_batch%20%3D%20tokenizer(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5B%5C%22We%20are%20very%20happy%20to%20show%20you%20the%20%F0%9F%A4%97%20Transformers%20library.%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22We%20hope%20you%20don't%20hate%20it.%5C%22%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20padding%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20truncation%3DTrue%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20max_length%3D512%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20return_tensors%3D%5C%22pt%5C%22%5Cn)%5Cnfor%20key%2C%20value%20in%20pt_batch.items()%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(f%5C%22%7Bkey%7D%3A%20%7Bvalue.numpy().tolist()%7D%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20input_ids%3A%20%5B%5B101%2C%202057%2C%202024%2C%202200%2C%203407%2C%202000%2C%202265%2C%202017%2C%201996%2C%20100%2C%2019081%2C%203075%2C%201012%2C%20102%5D%2C%20%5B101%2C%202057%2C%203246%2C%202017%2C%202123%2C%201005%2C%201056%2C%205223%2C%202009%2C%201012%2C%20102%2C%200%2C%200%2C%200%5D%5D%5Cn%23%20attention_mask%3A%20%5B%5B1%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%5D%2C%20%5B1%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%201%2C%200%2C%200%2C%200%5D%5D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22i6Dwm%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ueab4e02a\" id=\"ueab4e02a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87a6b840\" id=\"u87a6b840\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">注意 padding 出来的地方，attention_mask 为 0。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u09a82078\" id=\"u09a82078\"><span data-lake-id=\"u77d31852\" id=\"u77d31852\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">对于填充的部分，也会生成对应的 attention mask，但值为 0，因为填充部分不需要模型进行关注。更多关于 tokenizer 见</span><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/transformers/v4.6.0/preprocessing.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u0fe175da\" id=\"u0fe175da\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueed64c54\" id=\"ueed64c54\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(65, 131, 196)\">文档</span></a></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"8131e7eb\" id=\"8131e7eb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5e0fff59\" id=\"u5e0fff59\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">2.2 使用模型（model）</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u2e46ca92\" id=\"u2e46ca92\"><span data-lake-id=\"u53ac6828\" id=\"u53ac6828\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">一旦 tokenizer 处理好了对应的文本，我们就可以直接把处理好的结果传给对应的模型。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pt_outputs%20%3D%20pt_model(**pt_batch)%5Cnprint(pt_outputs)%5CnSequenceClassifierOutput(loss%3DNone%2C%20logits%3Dtensor(%5B%5B-4.0833%2C%20%204.3364%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5B%200.0818%2C%20-0.0418%5D%5D%2C%20grad_fn%3D%3CAddmmBackward%3E)%2C%20hidden_states%3DNone%2C%20attentions%3DNone)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22S2KWq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ubfacca1e\" id=\"ubfacca1e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u965bab12\" id=\"u965bab12\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">输出的 logits 是什么？</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc6b7bf18\" id=\"uc6b7bf18\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua58fe13e\" id=\"ua58fe13e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">形式：torch.FloatTensor of shape (batch_size, config.num_labels))</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u25e8220b\" id=\"u25e8220b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2508a440\" id=\"u2508a440\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">意义：Classification (or regression if config.num_labels==1) scores (before SoftMax)</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0af50625\" id=\"u0af50625\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0b930d9\" id=\"ua0b930d9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119)\">全部的 Transformers models（PyTorch 或 TensorFlow）返回模型在最终激活函数（如 SoftMax）之前的激活，因为该最终激活功能通常与损失函数混淆。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u5d8992be\" id=\"u5d8992be\"><span data-lake-id=\"u48ae0833\" id=\"u48ae0833\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">在最后的结果中使用 softmax 函数来获得最终的预测</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20torch%20import%20nn%5Cnpt_predictions%20%3D%20nn.functional.softmax(pt_outputs.logits%2C%20dim%3D-1)%5Cnprint(pt_predictions)%5Cn%5Cntensor(%5B%5B2.2043e-04%2C%209.9978e-01%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B5.3086e-01%2C%204.6914e-01%5D%5D%2C%20grad_fn%3D%3CSoftmaxBackward%3E)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dghid%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ufa56c479\" id=\"ufa56c479\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc8e95894\" id=\"uc8e95894\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">如果除了输入之外，还为模型提供标签，则模型输出对象还将包含损失属性：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20torch%5Cnpt_outputs%20%3D%20pt_model(**pt_batch%2C%20labels%20%3D%20torch.tensor(%5B1%2C%200%5D))%5Cnprint(pt_outputs)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UTJpZ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22SequenceClassifierOutput(loss%3Dtensor(0.3167%2C%20grad_fn%3D%3CNllLossBackward%3E)%2C%20logits%3Dtensor(%5B%5B-4.0833%2C%20%204.3364%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5B%200.0818%2C%20-0.0418%5D%5D%2C%20grad_fn%3D%3CAddmmBackward%3E)%2C%20hidden_states%3DNone%2C%20attentions%3DNone)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22W1jsR%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u02e44518\" id=\"u02e44518\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6daf94f2\" id=\"u6daf94f2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">训练完成后，保存模型</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22pt_save_directory%20%3D%20'.%2Fpt_save_pretrained'%5Cntokenizer.save_pretrained(pt_save_directory)%5Cnpt_model.save_pretrained(pt_save_directory)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lfA2x%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u95fb0986\" id=\"u95fb0986\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0123747a\" id=\"u0123747a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">也可以这样载入模型，即不使用 AutoModel 和 AutoTokenizer。</span><span data-lake-id=\"u50142243\" id=\"u50142243\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">transformers 库中每个架构加类的组合有一个模型类，因此如果需要，代码很容易访问和调整。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20DistilBertTokenizer%2C%20DistilBertForSequenceClassification%5Cnmodel_name%20%3D%20%5C%22distilbert-base-uncased-finetuned-sst-2-english%5C%22%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20DistilBertForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(model_name)%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20DistilBertTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SQgP5%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"ca02a21f\" id=\"ca02a21f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0132920a\" id=\"u0132920a\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">2.3 定制模型参数</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u299b4ea7\" id=\"u299b4ea7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6fa94815\" id=\"u6fa94815\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">如果要更改模型本身的构建方式，可以定义自定义配置类。每个体系结构都有自己的相关配置。例如，DistilBertConfig 允许您为 DistilBERT 指定隐藏层维度、dropout rate 等参数。如果您进行核心修改，例如更改隐藏层大小（hidden size），您将无法再使用预训练模型，需要从头开始训练。然后，您将直接从此配置实例化模型。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u596949a0\" id=\"u596949a0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uac29c8c0\" id=\"uac29c8c0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">下面，我们使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u46f85281\" id=\"u46f85281\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3ce9d467\" id=\"u3ce9d467\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">from_pretrained()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u099b1f02\" id=\"u099b1f02\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">方法加载 tokenizer 的预定义词汇表。然而，我们希望从头开始初始化模型。因此，我们从配置实例化模型，而不是使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u61574ccd\" id=\"u61574ccd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd1509f1\" id=\"ucd1509f1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">from_pretrained()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0152f46b\" id=\"u0152f46b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">方法。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20DistilBertConfig%2C%20DistilBertTokenizer%2C%20DistilBertForSequenceClassification%5Cnconfig%20%3D%20DistilBertConfig(n_heads%3D8%2C%20dim%3D512%2C%20hidden_dim%3D4*512)%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20DistilBertTokenizer.from_pretrained('distilbert-base-uncased')%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20DistilBertForSequenceClassification(config)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22d68Ml%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud6e91247\" id=\"ud6e91247\"><span data-lake-id=\"u250790e8\" id=\"u250790e8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">对于仅更改模型头部（例如，标签数量）的对象，仍然可以对主体使用预训练模型。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6031a431\" id=\"u6031a431\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08f2138b\" id=\"u08f2138b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">例如，让我们使用预训练体为 10 个不同的标签定义一个分类器。我们可以将配置需要的任何参数传递给 from_pretrained() 方法，它将适当地更新默认配置，而不是创建一个具有所有默认值的新配置来更改标签的数量：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20DistilBertConfig%2C%20DistilBertTokenizer%2C%20DistilBertForSequenceClassification%5Cnmodel_name%20%3D%20%5C%22distilbert-base-uncased%5C%22%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20DistilBertForSequenceClassification.from_pretrained(model_name%2C%20num_labels%3D10)%5Cntokenizer%20%3D%20DistilBertTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xnC0K%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 2440, "description": "示例代码📎transformers-demo.ppt注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压python版本：3.12.4现在做 NLP 方面的研究实在离不开预训练语言模型，尤其是 BERT。huggingface 的 transformers 包是目前使用 BERT 最主流最方便的工具之一注：由...", "updated_at": "2025-05-16T08:58:40.000Z", "created_at": "2025-04-20T14:38:46.000Z", "id": 216261133, "status": 1}